      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general, we don\u0027t increase this timeout because there are things platforms can do to improve the setup time, and if this timeout is larger, it will be difficult to start/stop Bluetooth in time.  (There are timeouts in Java for how long it takes to start Bluetooth, and this is just one part of that time)",
