      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, Myles san\n\nWe have discussed the timer of WAIT_FOR_INIT_TIMEOUT with Bluetooth IC vendor and\nthey says that current value of 2000mS is too small for their IC.\nIf this change is no accepted, all the device which uses their Bluetooth IC can not pass this VTS test.\nI am so afraid but could you please consider again to accept this change?\nThank you for your understanding.\n\nBest Regards.",
