      "writtenOn": "2023-05-03T10:30:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, Myles san\n\nThank you for reply.\nNo, it is not baud rate problem.\nThis phenom happen with only some high-end Bluetooth IC.\nI hear from IC vendor that since this IC support many latest techonology and high-functioning, it need to takes much time to initialize IC firmware by design.\nI ask you again to accept this change or can we do waiver this test case w/o commiting this change?\n\nBest Regards.\nShiroh",
      "parentUuid": "2318c636_aedd21ba",
      "revId": "4858152b7b19129e5cd04b9e076476052d4f61f0",
